{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1445,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69f9f25ef16546d70a33d16a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我所追求的并非是单纯的胜利。\r\n若无法留下鲜明又强烈的光芒，\r\n便称不上是家族的胜利……对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "643768e176ce85bbe3d0a06c1e7e2f19562d38c6c3b31cb814182c2026bed2af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55f42d433ddaf02b08069de0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你已经证明自己具备资格了。\r\n别恐惧、别害怕，\r\n只要致力于完成使命就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4725366433e80730765b621dac7f23fc6a78285b6ba6e48cb75863116a398151",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de180e9aa73e3351e02b9cb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏季集训是个特别的环境。\r\n让我们完美运用，好好锻练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06c5fd5046ca94e80d6f3aefde427312b561cb48c9434f714d6d02fce1fe6d25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df67d57b1687f4623b8833db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽地、轻盈地。\n让我们一同绽放辉煌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc0e1e5791b037c0f3a9299140a94e7159d7e8ae62dd7126592bcd6ba3548f62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2612726e64e78eb57e14ce24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "并非只有那轰鸣咆哮的火焰\n才拥有热度……\n我将为此证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "152640fb7b64a3509d31adbc4c96799872548bb3c85ab1be0a5cfaf5201fa5d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a86c63596aee69803cffef96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论在何种场合，都要展现出\n自己的存在感。像母亲大人那样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "940bf648443898f0cf40df8bc231dda922844750536d4f9ab46d2762c56dc689",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2deac86fe1a49e5ade68e473",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "足以吸引并魅惑众人的  \n能量……  \n我一定会掌握它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30818fd01c2a3135827558de19dbe5805aadefea97d01c28fa63514ea0071e96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5421c537f7bd13643e186ef1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……还远远称不上洗练呢。\n不满足于现状，不断磨炼的话，\n总有一天……",
      "source_fingerprint": "79a7666ae7b823fece9ee1b428d78d067d965d2da5a783e841b8e3c15b95201c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5cfdaa9d927aad65bf6902d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请不要忘记，如果想要将领先的位置\n托付给你，我们这边也需要有相应的觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b69fb622958698fe77313294411ac1e0c5b6de20c48be5aa22a5bd774082ec58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a81b59bf21c10f0de069f5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一族的玉条已铭刻在我身上。\n……您作为我的训练员，\n也请在心中铭刻信念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "971131563dfe86eb02fdc815f66116601b1630f7ba412f3f4879009836fe42ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:442d1fa66f26eda3059cf03e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿你的前途也充满光彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b0f5bf30ff059f5914474bcd0fd7ff920014bb68b4bb75c049f272f60055052",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:312af9ea1e1f70b8c91df4ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢你的鼎力相助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "724da46f4a98415403a189da285286fc43e710d8a0dd0599acb9fc1dbbf45372",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eee7cbfc78fd716567416fc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出色的护送表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac67b0e61ac516aa57e87d97c66a3af032a86aa60149c3bf97965bfb1cb9971",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:787954161f7acf484a84ad98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的火焰不会燃尽……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c65b2ca6edccefff53744b74505263d3b795360e34fd126bebed066850519667",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3e06d7365821c05070813dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我保证会拿出更加卓越的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfb340fda36a25f412564a659b6a67f1093fe5a2ed181c1324b6f8f70d0f7f5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00ac386ae58bb4026d819ff5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会绽放最耀眼的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6413057561673421f78ef67a2ea83d1a3bd4c3396addea89762ab8914db2b1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4b6c734b9448ac7a5285483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好，我是第一红宝石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f67c68eab278ac3a6f38ead5f350a08d417ef91e6686c1da15d2d4021f79115a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06abef170ddd36be78956e8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用深红的光芒为我们家族\r\n华丽的轨迹增添色彩吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53745ba0269c493a648a6f5bf99bf168efe07f10fa3574c465f1c8289b72b4ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3693d6af892d1b3af4291635",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帮助他人也是我的职责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6747d1726b041f1c5b14e62db38d7542ca98f68a37d20036e120327491148f7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8089ed93dd6c248a1201e9b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想必能做更进一步的钻研。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b244d93957b7936c2b25c654c8031f3c762b7ba1639c64c13854a823f4d0b345",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6f07e48abed649227c559eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "犹如升向天空的火焰一般……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d6d2a9e28d5e71c72ed9c93ecad440da9f2b82b791e57d13e20dc560f7c8bf1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24349fe72b23cabc1b5687de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们留下辉煌的灯火吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5b54bc6af221f3cf42a29d42f1296794cdf16300ef75019e1c44e36b87215bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40790f92ea57181a3ffd4aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以玲珑剔透的青色火焰为傲，  \n将我的存在铭刻于世吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c50a8b82be53e6abe7a9f298212805abfff96c405407bb5b36a926edb6a760a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2db574ff6197ffc784a93b40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是第一红宝石。来吧，请跟我来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53e973ebf8a6c88abc7b7311158bd83af87536c223bb7a0a59926ec39e8060bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0b8e4d4f298177faf664825",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参りましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "550ae0cca8ce02f21c817336ea537feb3001ba9442ddf10f4fb8bbc3e372fb1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eacfddd63c39289d88e01ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バーミリオン。\r\n…美しく発色してくれるかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16afa43b27fdb03600d3ce6e59280fffb1c75ff7f0975960eaa184c8f36a3243",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfa5f528dbd5043e5e568e1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e42824481b89139758cebcbc6de379bc2bfe391af6bc5931ce02cac1bdb2432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edd66d196175d727dfd97e21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc0c8f83eb8682c9bf224335",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方の愛…\r\nどうぞ、捧げてご覧なさいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d26c0d92b74c35da5bb9df84eeb3193f87fe61d50f4653df6b0492d3bba538",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48538d36e0af57d29c530e09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クロッキーのモデル。\r\nお願いしようかしら。\r\n…あのポーズ以外でね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "38d307c032d28596931cf8437fce98d35add81bea0a91da3bb19b09113b6c04d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:598c09a8c55ee15f344104dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あけましておめでとうございます。\r\n今年もどうぞ、よろしく…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7806197341d3a089d7b61252da3b03120d804ef45750ba973af8344ba2080c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f73dbe1d38797ea68a32bb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バレンタイン。\r\nそれで？",
      "source_fingerprint": "095f2cdf173dc71f2546abf6ee259bf88da78d45e831cbf49978e2db5f461c98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91895ecce2776543d5ba148e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコレートでよろしいの？\r\n欲がないのね。それとも…\r\n意気地がないのかしら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6784e0965b6c152767a774f8c30c82c5f473d155891da14cc0462c578819127e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f2c1d2f1f089143586e516f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "短冊はアルダンに渡してくださる。\r\n願う権利は、あの子にあげるわ。\r\n私はもう…祈らないの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a56788940cdbf63bfbb8677a174831229f87ac2652425472f29e3f5a143ca93b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:782ebb995f20a77279165e18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "悪戯ね…。したいの？\r\nそれとも…してほしい？\r\nふふ、嫌よ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1166677a074dd8b2f62eb1b8815d793d2eed818c703e8135ae807cc171ae219e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ce918a78b6aeba9ee398163",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最初の挨拶はライアンだったわ。\r\nあの子たち、毎年メリークリスマス\r\nを言いに来るの…可愛いでしょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4ea873d8e5beb4b428581dbc7a364c77847f44bcbaba1f2d2e1a6c0e1de1153",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d18fce768a3df9e69a989f07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方、正装に着替えてくださる。\r\nクリスマスパーティーに、\r\n顔を出したい気分なの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4a394229c137ef712fa1e7d3449b2c95f36366707b0a0ca54fead83107686d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1156c8068470d44c6832f758",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝ったわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e92953563f1bc8d5260d381b0b55f254d35e31966fd4a190044ea5d4d2fb6aa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7b5ffd8108aab5a10dea847",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もうすぐ、また新しい年が始まる…\r\nどんなレースが待っているのか、\r\n期待して迎えましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5eeb5a0fca8ce935e7497bede370d70a66595fc5094c5facb734030ae856edf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21decc728118834ac9583667",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ、誕生日ですのね。\r\nおめでとう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aff5875eab35bc290d8d0b8a58225046f6ed294df6d3ef5cac81746692ff7e5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66c2f7423d4328d28c280012",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おめでとう。…あら、\r\n誕生日じゃなかったかしら。\r\nお祝いの言葉を、贈りますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4ee970bc924eec5eb2b039043b24eff0adaa6763a1b362e7c08c9bca6682b8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcd0f578b9a13a2a1cebb75e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そうだ、貴方…アクセサリーを\r\n試してみたら。今日は家に、\r\nたくさん届くの…差し上げるわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fc116d21444adeee5e68b6da1fd5dea4b58cae9dca67df8fadc01489c7e03b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beb6983f289b4a7fde98c9cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誕生日…ね。貴方が、\r\n大切に思わせてくださるの？\r\n忘れられないお祝いで…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d91bf7066b25cb8b31f049e164167a1025a64c9019e2236c841b9b25e3674526",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8b5e4cdd43c2ab85287cca0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お知らせ…ですって。\r\nご覧になったら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e5c5a46a9b4f162aac3b90f0d472998c8512f81c76ae400234b6a7e97b74c06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1086",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:866619199403d1182df75359",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方にプレゼントがあるそうよ。\r\nよかったですわね。",
